{"availability":"available","full":"brennanbrown/11ty-Indie-Web-Blog-Starter","name":"11ty-Indie-Web-Blog-Starter","description":"🎈 A modern, feature-complete blog template built with Eleventy and Chota CSS. Designed for writers who want to own their content and participate in the IndieWeb.","category":"Design","language":"Nunjucks","stars":25,"forks":2,"created":"2025-08-19T21:41:02Z","updated":"2026-08-27T06:34:29Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://indieweb-blog-starter.netlify.app/","topics":["11ty","11ty-starter","11ty-template","blog-theme","indieweb","jamstack"],"demo":"https://indieweb-blog-starter.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:01:30.800Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:01:30.800Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:01:30.800Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T01:09:40.511Z","stars":25,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:01:30.800Z","stars":25,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A minimal, performant, and accessible Eleventy starter for the IndieWeb.","A minimal Eleventy starter for people getting into the IndieWeb for the first time. Files that matter are commented, conventions are visible in the file tree, and nothing meaningful is hardcoded into templates. It lives in src/data/site.js or another data file instead.","This starter includes IndieWeb microformats and webmentions because they're useful and fun to explore. However, I don't believe a site needs these to be \"IndieWeb.\" The IndieWeb is about principles, not specs."],"features":["Good faith code. Good faith writing. No invasive trackers, ads, or a11y-hostile design. Write from a place of good faith, believing the internet can still be good.","A pro-social attitude. The web is meant to be social. Your site should have some social element, even if it's just contact information.","Be fun. Be accessible. Be small. Express yourself. Follow WCAG guidelines. Keep your site performant. Make it work wi